{"id":"654415","name":"腌酸木瓜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654415/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"木瓜","amount":"1200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青木瓜。","img":"images/654415/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"削去皮。","img":"images/654415/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切开后，里面有白白的籽。","img":"images/654415/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用勺子把里面的内膜刮干净，否则会影响口感。","img":"images/654415/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成薄片。","img":"images/654415/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"撒入适量的盐拌匀。","img":"images/654415/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌制30分钟，杀出水分。","img":"images/654415/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接下来的时间，把小米椒洗干净。","img":"images/654415/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切圈备用。","img":"images/654415/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把腌制软的木瓜放入清水内，泡洗干净，去除咸味。","img":"images/654415/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"攥干水分。","img":"images/654415/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盆里放入米醋、黄冰糖、凉白开。","img":"images/654415/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再倒入小米椒。","img":"images/654415/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把糖醋水浇入木瓜内拌匀。","img":"images/654415/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再装入干净的罐子里。","img":"images/654415/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"密封好放冰箱保存，腌制一个晚上就可以吃了。","img":"images/654415/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654415/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}